OL,3,GNEWSAGovernment condemns 'thuggish'
OL,4,Abehaviour in Portsmouth after second
OL,5,Asmall boats protest of weekend
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe government condemns "intimidating
OL,8,Fand thuggish behaviour" by hundreds of
OL,9,Fpeople protesting against small boat
OL,10,Farrivals in Portsmouth last night
OL,12,FCrowds blocked roads after 140 migrants
OL,13,Fwere brought to shore in Hampshire -
OL,14,Fmuch further west than where small
OL,15,Fboats usually arrive
OL,17,FProtesters were trying to stop the
OL,18,Fmigrants being taken to the Manston
OL,19,Fprocessing centre in Kent
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,336,330,200,160,0,100
